    <DemoExample Title="Templates" RazorCode="@example18RazorCode" CsharpCode="@example18CsharpCode" Id="example18">
        <div class="example-desc">
            Every cell of the calendar can be rendered by the application. <b>LabelTemplate</b> and <b>IconTemplate</b>
            replace the label and the input's icon, while <b>DayCellTemplate</b> and <b>MonthCellTemplate</b> receive
            the date of the cell being rendered and <b>YearCellTemplate</b> receives its year number, so each can
